{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["את פני פרכת — by the plain sense: before the face of the parokhet of the sanctuary, the parokhet that separates between the Holy and the Holy of Holies. And what Scripture specifies there, 'the parokhet of the sanctuary,' implies that the sprinklings were opposite the middle of the parokhet on the outside, opposite the ark of the sanctuary on the inside."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:48:16.969296264Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}